    <cmt>caution</cmt>
    <sym>Dot</sym>
    <type>danger</type>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="43.95668683103128" lon="-79.86752569145881">
    <name>Route Alternative</name>
    <cmt>control</cmt>
    <desc>Riders can bypass the upcoming trails by riding south on Duffy Lane and then hopping on the rail trail (Caledon Trailway) off of Patterson Side Road. Take the trail east to meet up with the route in Palgrave.</desc>
    <sym>Dot</sym>
    <type>checkpoint</type>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="45.74644894980009" lon="-82.05557890989968">
    <name>Route Alternative</name>
    <cmt>control</cmt>
    <desc>Riders can choose to stay on main road here going south.</desc>
    <sym>Dot</sym>
    <type>checkpoint</type>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="45.16104230766402" lon="-81.34229858019621">
    <name>Route Option</name>
    <cmt>control</cmt>
    <desc>Optional out-and-back to Cabot Lighthouse along a fun coastal road that is closed to traffic. A unique cycling opportunity in the area.</desc>
    <sym>Dot</sym>
    <type>checkpoint</type>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="45.10940297473619" lon="-81.31245254933087">
    <name>Route Option</name>
    <cmt>control</cmt>
    <desc>You can take this excellent path to Cape Chin for a great viewpoint and camping option.  Worth it! </desc>
    <sym>Dot</sym>
    <type>checkpoint</type>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="45.14248290469611" lon="-81.33862332863339">
    <name>Some rocky sections on trail. Should all be rideable</name>
    <cmt>caution</cmt>
