    <cmt>control</cmt>
    <desc>For a side-trip to two epic lookouts continue straight on this dirt road. When you get to a T-junction where the Bruce trail runs in about 1.5km make a right on the dirt road and you'll come to the lookouts. At the second lookout you need to backtrack as the road does not continue through. The first lookout is about 2km and the second is about 2.5km from this intersection. </desc>
